  "description": "Prior approval under Class A of Part 20, Schedule 2 of the GPDO (as amended) for the construction of a single storey roof extension at blocks 78-94 And 79-95 Watermint Quay to provide 4 x new residential units.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development does not benefit from the parameters of permitted development as set out under Class A, Part 20, Schedule 2 of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 2015 (as amended) as it has not been sufficiently demonstrated that the site contains detached blocks of flats.",
    "In the absence of a suitable undertaking to secure that the occupiers of the new residential units would not be able to apply for on street parking permits, the proposals would have an adverse impact on street parking conditions, highway safety,&nbsp; sustainable modes of transport and would contribute to congestion in the surrounding area contrary to Policies T1 and T4 of the London Plan (2021) and Hackney Local Plan Policies LP43 and LP45. Having regard to The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015, Part A.2(1)(a), the change of use is not supported on the basis of adverse impact on on-street parking conditions and highway safety."
  ],
